<!--	NODE/ATTRIBUTE LIST

Note: Refer to SP_MENU_DISPLAY_ID_ENUM in SP_Debug_Menu.sch for available displayID's
	  and SP_MENU_CODE_ID_ENUM in SP_Debug_Menu.sch for available codeID's.
	  The title and author attributes can link to text labels in the american.gxt.
	  
	  
Title
-	Description: The name that will appear at the top of the debug menu.
-	Node: menuTitle
-	Attributes: title
-	Example: <menuTitle title="SP Debug Menu"/>

Menu
-	Description: Opens up a sub level for the user to browse. Sub items stored in additional xml file.
-	Node: menuItem
-	Attributes: title, file, displayID(optional)
-	Example: <menuItem title="DM_HEISTS" file="SPDebug/SP_heists.xml"/>

Mission
-	Description: Displays all the info on a mission and can launch the script with optional player warp/heading.
-	Node: missionItem
-	Attributes: missionID, title, file, author, percentage, infoLine1(optional), infoLine2(optional), x(optional), y(optional), z(optional), heading(optional), highlight(optional), codeID(optional), displayID(optional), character(optiona), codeID1-4(optional)
-	Example: <missionItem missionID="TM_01" file="SniperSwap.sc" author="SI_DW" percentage="30" highlight="FALSE" x="870.6724" y="-2095.0288" z="29.4596" character="CHAR_TREVOR" heading="180.0" info="DM_INFO_001"/>

Script
-	Description: Launch the specified script with optional player warp/heading.
-	Node: scriptItem
-	Attributes: title, file, x(optional), y(optional), z(optional), heading(optional), author(optional) , codeID(optional), displayID(optional)
-	Example: <scriptItem title="Clothes Shop" file="shop_Example.sc" x="-1249.6451" y="-1141.2218" z="6.7833" author="SI_KR"/>

Warp
-	Description: Sets the players coordinates with optional heading.
-	Node: warpItem
-	Attributes: title, x, y, z, author(optional), percentage(optional), highlight(optional), heading(optional), codeID(optional), displayID(optional) 
-	Example: <warpItem title="Wardrobe" x="-1245.552" y="-1139.976" z="6.7876" author="SI_KR" percentage="10%" highlight=TRUE/>

Code
-	Description: Runs a piece of hardcoded script in **_Debug_Menu.sch.
-	Node: codeItem
-	Attributes: title, codeID, displayID(optional)
-	Example: <codeItem title="Start Last Failed Stage" codeID="SPCID_CHEM_HEIST_FAILED" displayID="SPDID_CHEM_FAILED"/>

Break
-	Description: Puts a non-selectable break line in the menu.
-	Node: breakItem
-	Attributes: none
-	Example: <breakItem/>


-->
